abstract: >-
  Agent Bill of Materials (AgentBOM) generator and validator
  for AI agent supply chain security. Inventories MCP servers,
  model artifacts, prompts, retrieval configurations, A2A agent
  cards, IDE agent settings, and package dependencies — then checks
  integrity, scores risk, and exports standard BOMs.
